    "label": {
      "size": 13,
      "weight": 500,
      "lineHeight": 18,
      "tracking": 0
    },
    "caption": {
      "size": 11,
      "weight": 600,
      "lineHeight": 16,
      "tracking": 1.6,
      "uppercase": true
    }
  },
  "rules": [
    "meridian.500 (#E0A03A) is NEVER text on a light background: it gives 2.1:1. Use meridian.600 (#8A5A0B).",
    "A vesper.300 (#8B7DFF) fill in the dark theme carries #0E1420 text, not white: white gives 3.2:1.",
    "In the dark theme, hierarchy comes from surfaces, not from shadows.",
    "Every new text/background pair must clear 4.5:1 in both themes.",
    "OFF_HOURS and UNKNOWN text in the light theme is slate #5B5C74 (6.51:1), not slateLight #9C9DB4, which gave 2.66:1 on white. Measured 2026-08-29.",
    "Local times and counters use tabular figures.",
    "iOS: Liquid Glass only in the chrome (tab bar, navigation, sheets). Content is always opaque.",
    "Android: turn Material You dynamic colour off explicitly."
  ],
